  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building of the Provincial Coordination and Execution of External Funding Unit (UPCEFE) for Designing, Formulating and Executing Programmes and Projects with External Funding in Rio Negro Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project responds to a request from the Government of the Argentine Province of R&#xED;o Negro for IOM&#x2019;s assistance with the administrative management of the programme &#x201C;Strengthening Capabilities of the Provincial Unit for Coordination and Execution of External Financing (UPECEFE) to Design, Formulate and Execute Provincials/Municipals Programs and Projects Driven by Rio Negro Province with External Founds for Rio Negro Province&#x201D;. Through its Administrative and Financial Management Unit (UGAF), IOM will provide administrative, financial, supervision/control and monitoring services to ensure a transparent and efficient execution of the above programme.</narrative>
  </description>
